# Only the throwaway root lockfile is ignored. Sub-project lockfiles MUST be
# committed: the backend and market Dockerfiles build with `npm ci`, which
# refuses to run without one. Keep the leading slash — without it this pattern
# matches every package-lock.json in the tree.
/package-lock.json

